:: Widgets MP Ledger Debt [widget nobr]
<<widget "mpLedgerInit">>
<<set _today to ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0)>>
<<if !$mpLedger>>
	<<set $mpLedger to { week: 1, amount: 1500, protected: [0, 0, 0], overdue: 0, route: "none", paid: 0, outcome: "", paidWindow: 0, nextDueDay: _today + 7, childTaken: 0, lastNightDay: -1 }>>
<</if>>
<<if !$mpLedger.protected>><<set $mpLedger.protected to [0, 0, 0]>><</if>>
<<set $mpLedger.week to ($mpLedger.week or 1)>>
<<set $mpLedger.amount to ($mpLedger.amount or 1500)>>
<<set $mpLedger.overdue to ($mpLedger.overdue or 0)>>
<<set $mpLedger.paid to ($mpLedger.paid or 0)>>
<<if $mpLedger.outcome is undefined>><<set $mpLedger.outcome to "">><</if>>
<<if $mpLedger.nextDueDay is undefined>><<set $mpLedger.nextDueDay to _today + 7>><</if>>
<<if $mpLedger.paidWindow is undefined>><<set $mpLedger.paidWindow to $mpLedger.amount>><</if>>
<<if $mpLedger.childTaken is undefined>><<set $mpLedger.childTaken to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpLedger.lastNightDay is undefined>><<set $mpLedger.lastNightDay to -1>><</if>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "mpLedgerTick">>
<<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set _today to ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0)>>
<<if !$mpLedgerEnded and _today gte ($mpLedger.nextDueDay or _today + 7)>>
	<<set _oldDue to ($mpLedger.amount or 1500)>>
	<<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>>
	<<set $mpLedger.week to (($mpLedger.week or 1) + 1)>>
	<<set $mpLedger.amount to Math.min(3000, 1500 + _protCnt * 350)>>
	<<if ($mpLedger.paidWindow or 0) lt _oldDue>><<set $mpLedger.overdue to (($mpLedger.overdue or 0) + 1)>><</if>>
	<<set $mpLedger.paidWindow to 0>>
	<<set $mpLedger.nextDueDay to (($mpLedger.nextDueDay or _today) + 7)>>
	<<if $mpLedger.nextDueDay lte _today>><<set $mpLedger.nextDueDay to _today + 7>><</if>>
<</if>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "mpLedgerPay">>
<<mpLedgerInit>>
<<if !$mpLedgerEnded>>
	<<set _due to ($mpLedger.amount or 1500)>>
	<<set _need to Math.max(0, _due - ($mpLedger.paidWindow or 0))>>
	<<if _need gt 0>>
	<<set $mpLedger.paid to (($mpLedger.paid or 0) + _need)>>
	<<set $mpLedger.paidWindow to (($mpLedger.paidWindow or 0) + _need)>>
	<<set $mpLedger.overdue to 0>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "mpLedgerProtect">>
<<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set _idx to (_args[0] or 0)>>
<<set $mpLedger.protected[_idx] to 1>>
<<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>>
<<set $mpLedger.amount to Math.min(3000, 1500 + _protCnt * 350)>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "mpLedgerLoseProtect">>
<<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set _lost to -1>>
<<if $mpLedger.protected[2] is 1>><<set _lost to 2>>
<<elseif $mpLedger.protected[1] is 1>><<set _lost to 1>>
<<elseif $mpLedger.protected[0] is 1>><<set _lost to 0>><</if>>
<<if _lost gte 0>>
	<<set $mpLedger.protected[_lost] to 0>>
	<<set $mpWorldLedgerLoss to (($mpWorldLedgerLoss or 0) + 1)>>
	<<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>>
	<<set $mpLedger.amount to Math.min(3000, 1500 + _protCnt * 350)>>
<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: MP Ledger Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>><<mpLedgerTick>>
<<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>>
<<set _nextIn to Math.max(0, ($mpLedger.nextDueDay or 0) - ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>>
地下储煤间尽头有一道被煤灰盖住的暗门，门后藏着院长室那本从不示人的私账。灯下摊开的账页只记三件事：第 <<print $mpLedger.week>> 周原额 <<print $mpLedger.amount>> 钱，按今日行价折 <<mpWorldPrice $mpLedger.amount>>；逾期栏<<if $mpLedger.overdue gt 0>>圈着 <<print $mpLedger.overdue>> 笔红墨<<else>>还空着<</if>>，保护栏<<if _protCnt is 3>>三个名字都写定了<<elseif _protCnt gt 0>>写进了 <<print _protCnt>> 个名字<<else>>一格未动<</if>>。距下次翻账还有 <<print _nextIn>> 天，页脚<<if $mpLedger.outcome is "clear">>已经写着「结清」<<elseif $mpLedger.outcome is "seize">>写着「夺账」<<elseif $mpLedger.outcome is "escape">>写着「转移」<<else>>还没有落笔<</if>>。<<if $mpWorldOrphanageOutcome is "mutualaid">>院里已经办起了互助工坊。<<elseif $mpWorldOrphanageOutcome is "sheltered">>院里的门窗都换了新闩。<<else>>院里的木牌还没什么变化。<</if>><<if $mpWorldLedgerLoss>>保护栏里有一个名字被炭条抹掉了。<<elseif $mpLedgerEnded>>这一笔账已经落定，不会再翻。<<else>>贝利的人还没察觉这道暗门。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院枢 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[核算交割 (0:06)|MP Ledger Pay]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[查看三条救援线 (0:04)|MP Ledger Rescue Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[翻补充账页 (0:04)|MP Ledger Debt More Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<link [[回孤儿院熄灯歇下 (0:06)|MP Loc Orphanage Sleep]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Rescue Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>>
三条救援分线各通向一处抵债窝点：旧港冷库、高街账房、郊外谷仓。皮普、克拉拉、托比的名字还没有全进保护栏，救回一个，连坐周债就多三百五十钱，名单也更难从贝利眼皮底下藏住。如今保护栏里<<if _protCnt is 3>>三个名字都写定了<<elseif _protCnt gt 0>>已经写进 <<print _protCnt>> 个名字<<else>>还空着<</if>>，逾期 <<print $mpLedger.overdue>> 笔。每救回一人，名单上就少一处能把孩子随手点走的口子。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回账本总枢 (0:02)|MP Ledger Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去救皮普 (0:10)|MP Ledger Rescue Pip]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[去高街救克拉拉 (0:10)|MP Ledger Rescue Clara]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[去郊外农庄接托比 (0:10)|MP Ledger Rescue Toby]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Pay [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>>
<<set _due to ($mpLedger.amount or 1500)>>
铜壶水汽在窗上凝成白雾，黑账摊在煤油灯下：前面已核销 <<print $mpLedger.paid>> 钱，本期原额 <<print _due>> 钱，逾期 <<print $mpLedger.overdue>> 笔，已护孤儿 <<print _protCnt>> 人。罗宾替你把算盘珠拨回梁下，你可在此核销本周账期，也可以走阳光清偿、反制夺账，或按保护人数去应付连坐问责。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总枢 (0:02)|MP Ledger Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<set _need to Math.max(0, _due - ($mpLedger.paidWindow or 0))>>
<<if !$mpLedgerEnded>>
<<if _need lte 0>><span class="disabled">本期账已结清 (0:10)</span><br>
<<else>><<mpscaleicon>><<link "核销本周账 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<if ($money or 0) gte _need>><<set $money to (($money or 0) - _need)>><<mpLedgerPay>><<stress -2>><<else>><<pain 4>><<stress 5>><</if>><<goto "MP Ledger Hub">><</link>><br><</if>>
<</if>>
<<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[走阳光账清偿 (0:15)|MP Ledger Ending Clear]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<mpfist2icon>><<link [[反制夺账或转移 (0:15)|MP Ledger Ending Seize]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<link [[应对四档连坐问责 (0:10)|MP Ledger Punish Hub]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Rescue Pip [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
旧港冷库的排气扇在雾里慢转，皮普缩在鳕鱼箱与盐桶之间，袖口结满冰碴，手指冻得通红还在翻检冻鱼。管事把他的工钱直接折进贝利的连坐账里，越干越欠。<<if $mpLedger.protected[0] is 1>>如今皮普的名字已经圈进保护栏，冷库只剩空工位。<<else>>趁管事去前厅记秤，可以从排水暗道把皮普悄悄接走。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回救援分线 (0:02)|MP Ledger Rescue Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[从冷库后门接皮普 (0:15)|MP Ledger Rescue Pip After]]>><<pass 15>><<if $mpLedger.protected[0] is 1 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 220 or ($mpSafehouses and $mpSafehouses.docks and $mpSafehouses.docks.tier gte 1)>><<set $mpLedgerRescueOk to 1>><<else>><<set $mpLedgerRescueOk to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[先转去交割台 (0:04)|MP Ledger Pay]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Rescue Pip After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<if ($mpLedgerRescueOk or 0) is 1>>
你借着冷库后巷的雾气撬开活扣，把冻得发抖的皮普裹进干大衣，顺着码头安全屋的暗道一路送回孤儿院。罗宾早已备好热姜汤，皮普的名字正式划出抵债栏、写进保护名单。
<<if $mpLedger.protected[0] isnt 1>><<mpLedgerProtect 0>><<stress -3>><</if>>
<<else>>
冷库铁门的挂锁锈死了，管事听见铁链响动提着木棍赶来，你们只能借着鱼箱掩护先行撤退。皮普低声让你别硬拼，等摸清换班空当或是码头安全屋打通后再来接他。
<<set $mpLedger.overdue += 1>><<set $mpLedger.patrolPending to 1>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回救援分线 (0:02)|MP Ledger Rescue Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[回账本总枢核数 (0:04)|MP Ledger Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Rescue Clara [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
高街典当行二楼的小账房闷得透不过气，克拉拉伏在矮案前抄写抵债契，手腕被桌沿磨出红印。账房先生把她的学徒契压在铁匣底层，拿她的算术手艺白抵院里的利息。<<if $mpLedger.protected[1] is 1>>如今克拉拉的名字已经写进保护栏，矮案前空无一人。<<else>>趁账房先生下楼验银，可以抽走那张抵债原契。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回救援分线 (0:02)|MP Ledger Rescue Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[抽换底契接克拉拉 (0:15)|MP Ledger Rescue Clara After]]>><<pass 15>><<if $mpLedger.protected[1] is 1 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($mpStanding and ($mpStanding.guilds or 0) gte 15)>><<set $mpLedgerRescueOk to 1>><<else>><<set $mpLedgerRescueOk to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[先转去交割台 (0:04)|MP Ledger Pay]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Rescue Clara After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<if ($mpLedgerRescueOk or 0) is 1>>
你用早备好的废契换出铁匣底层的原纸，将克拉拉的名字改记进百工行会学徒册，护着她从后梯走下高街。回到孤儿院煤房后，克拉拉主动接过了核对周债红杠的差事。
<<if $mpLedger.protected[1] isnt 1>><<mpLedgerProtect 1>><<stress -3>><</if>>
<<else>>
铁匣加了双簧暗锁，楼梯口又传来账房先生上楼的咳嗽声。克拉拉赶紧把账册合拢向你摇了摇头，你只能先退回街面，等理顺账目门路或攒够行会人情再来改契。
<<set $mpLedger.overdue += 1>><<set $mpLedger.patrolPending to 1>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回救援分线 (0:02)|MP Ledger Rescue Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[回账本总枢核数 (0:04)|MP Ledger Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Rescue Toby [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
郊外农庄的谷仓里堆满潮湿草捆，托比拄着铁叉站在通风口下，腿上的旧伤让他每走一步都直冒冷汗。两名黑手套在土路拐角巡看，拿他抵孤儿院欠下的草料运费。<<if $mpLedger.protected[2] is 1>>如今托比已经平安返院，谷仓只剩空草袋。<<else>>只要哄住谷仓外的牧羊犬，就能趁换岗空当背他离开。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回救援分线 (0:02)|MP Ledger Rescue Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[趁换岗背走小托比 (0:15)|MP Ledger Rescue Toby After]]>><<pass 15>><<if $mpLedger.protected[2] is 1 or ($athletics or 0) gte 220 or ($tending or 0) gte 220>><<set $mpLedgerRescueOk to 1>><<else>><<set $mpLedgerRescueOk to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[先转去交割台 (0:04)|MP Ledger Pay]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Rescue Toby After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<if ($mpLedgerRescueOk or 0) is 1>>
你丢出半块肉干安抚住牧羊犬，背起腿脚不便的托比穿过田埂矮树丛，赶在黑手套折返前上了接应板车。托比的名字稳稳写进保护栏第三格，院里的孩子们围上来替他热敷旧伤。
<<if $mpLedger.protected[2] isnt 1>><<mpLedgerProtect 2>><<stress -3>><</if>>
<<else>>
谷仓外的牧羊犬忽然狂吠起来，黑手套提着风灯快步逼近。你只得把干粮塞进托比手里先行撤离，等练足脚力或备好安抚牲口的手法再来接他返院。
<<set $mpLedger.overdue += 1>><<set $mpLedger.patrolPending to 1>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回救援分线 (0:02)|MP Ledger Rescue Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[回账本总枢核数 (0:04)|MP Ledger Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Ending Clear [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set _canClear to ($mpLedger.outcome is "clear") or ((($mpLedger.overdue or 0) is 0) and ((($mpLedger.amount or 0) is 0) or (($mpLedger.paidWindow or 0) gte ($mpLedger.amount or 0))))>>
<<set _endLocked to ($mpLedgerEnded and $mpLedger.outcome isnt "clear")>>
煤油灯下摊着那本从不示人的私账，页脚留着一块空白，等着最后一笔红墨。罗宾把算盘推到一边，孩子们在楼上安静下来，走廊尽头只剩风声。
<br><br>
<<if _endLocked>>
页脚已经被<<if $mpLedger.outcome is "seize">>「夺账」<<elseif $mpLedger.outcome is "escape">>「转移」<<else>>别的结局<</if>>占住，再翻也改不回来。
<<elseif !_canClear>>
逾期栏还空不了，核销的钱也抵不上本期原额，贝利不会认这一笔。
<<else>>
<<set _firstClear to ($mpLedger.outcome isnt "clear")>>
<<set $mpLedgerEnded to 1>><<set $mpLedger.outcome to "clear">><<set $mpLedger.overdue to 0>>
<<if _firstClear>>
<<set $mpWorldOrphanageOutcome to "mutualaid">>
<<set $mpBaileyBiweeklyNextDay to ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0) + 28>>
<<set $mpAlert to Math.max(0, ($mpAlert or 0) - 8)>>
<<if $mpSafehouses and $mpSafehouses.orphanage>><<set $mpSafehouses.orphanage.risk to Math.max(0, ($mpSafehouses.orphanage.risk or 20) - 6)>><</if>>
<</if>>
最后一笔周债当众结清，罗宾在页脚写下「结清」，贝利的催账期被推迟了四周，只是人情簿上又添了一笔。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回账本总枢 (0:04)|MP Ledger Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -6>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[返回孤儿院总枢 (0:04)|MP Loc Orphanage Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Ending Seize [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>>
<<set _tierMax to 0>>
<<if $mpSafehouses>><<set _tierMax to Math.max(($mpSafehouses.docks.tier or 0), ($mpSafehouses.orphanage.tier or 0), ($mpSafehouses.temple.tier or 0), ($mpSafehouses.highstreet.tier or 0), ($mpSafehouses.forest.tier or 0), ($mpSafehouses.school.tier or 0))>><</if>>
<<set _canSeize to ($mpLedger.outcome is "seize") or (_protCnt gte 1) or (_tierMax gte 1)>>
<<set _endLocked to ($mpLedgerEnded and $mpLedger.outcome isnt "seize")>>
院长室的门缝里透出一线灯光，那本原始底账就压在写字台抽屉的最底层。罗宾守在楼梯口，替你把风，也替你数着巡夜的梆子声。
<br><br>
<<if _endLocked>>
页脚已经被<<if $mpLedger.outcome is "clear">>「结清」<<elseif $mpLedger.outcome is "escape">>「转移」<<else>>别的结局<</if>>占住，再翻也改不回来。
<<elseif !_canSeize>>
保护栏还是空的，也没打通孤儿院安全屋，现在夺不回这本账。
<<else>>
<<set _firstSeize to ($mpLedger.outcome isnt "seize")>>
<<set $mpLedgerEnded to 1>><<set $mpLedger.outcome to "seize">><<set $mpLedger.overdue to 0>>
<<if _firstSeize>>
<<set $mpWorldOrphanageOutcome to "sheltered">>
<<set $mpBaileyBiweeklyNextDay to ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0) + 21>>
<<set $mpAlert to Math.min(100, ($mpAlert or 0) + 6)>>
<<if $mpSafehouses and $mpSafehouses.orphanage>><<set $mpSafehouses.orphanage.risk to Math.max(0, ($mpSafehouses.orphanage.risk or 20) - 4)>><</if>>
<</if>>
你趁夜把原始底账连同假印信一并夺回，拆成三份藏进夹墙。没了底册，贝利再没法随便给孩子安上连坐利钱，门外却多了几道认得你的暗哨。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回账本总枢 (0:04)|MP Ledger Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -6>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[返回孤儿院总枢 (0:04)|MP Loc Orphanage Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Ending Escape [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set _tierMax to 0>>
<<if $mpSafehouses>><<set _tierMax to Math.max(($mpSafehouses.docks.tier or 0), ($mpSafehouses.orphanage.tier or 0), ($mpSafehouses.temple.tier or 0), ($mpSafehouses.highstreet.tier or 0), ($mpSafehouses.forest.tier or 0), ($mpSafehouses.school.tier or 0))>><</if>>
<<set _canEscape to ($mpLedger.outcome is "escape") or (_tierMax gte 1)>>
<<set _endLocked to ($mpLedgerEnded and $mpLedger.outcome isnt "escape")>>
煤房暗门后压着一张手绘的城图，图钉标出六处能过夜的窝，暗渠用炭条连成一条线。罗宾把最小的孩子抱在膝上，等你决定要不要走这条线。
<br><br>
<<if _endLocked>>
页脚已经被<<if $mpLedger.outcome is "clear">>「结清」<<elseif $mpLedger.outcome is "seize">>「夺账」<<else>>别的结局<</if>>占住，再翻也改不回来。
<<elseif !_canEscape>>
六处窝还都是空壳，没有一处能关门过夜，孩子们搬不出去。
<<else>>
<<set _firstEscape to ($mpLedger.outcome isnt "escape")>>
<<set $mpLedgerEnded to 1>><<set $mpLedger.outcome to "escape">><<set $mpLedger.overdue to 0>>
<<if _firstEscape>>
<<set $mpWorldOrphanageOutcome to "sheltered">>
<<set $mpBaileyBiweeklyNextDay to ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0) + 35>>
<<set $mpAlert to Math.max(0, ($mpAlert or 0) - 6)>>
<<if $mpSafehouses and $mpSafehouses.orphanage>><<set $mpSafehouses.orphanage.risk to Math.max(0, ($mpSafehouses.orphanage.risk or 20) - 10)>><</if>>
<</if>>
借着暗道，你把名单上的孩子分批转移到旧港与森林的据点，抹去原账上的名字。贝利翻开空栏时无处抓人，只是农庄土路上多了一组黑手套。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回账本总枢 (0:04)|MP Ledger Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -6>><</link>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[前往安全屋总枢 (0:04)|MP Safehouse Network Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Punish Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>>
煤房暗门内另有一册连坐问责簿，纸页按保护栏的名字分成四档：零护时来的是催账领班，一护时来搜房的是账房，二护时会在街口截车，三护齐全则由贝利亲自带着总账房上门。如今保护栏<<if _protCnt is 3>>三个名字都写定了<<elseif _protCnt gt 0>>写进了 <<print _protCnt>> 个名字<<else>>还空着<</if>>。<<if $mpWorldLedgerPunishLocked>>总账终裁已落印，不再派人搜门。<<else>>门外脚步声渐近，必须按档应对。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回交割 (0:02)|MP Ledger Pay]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<set _punishLabel to "">><<set _punishTarget to "">><<set _punishMin to 0>>
<<if _protCnt is 0>><<set _punishLabel to "应付逾期催账 (0:10)">><<set _punishTarget to "MP Ledger Punish Overdue 1">><<set _punishMin to 10>><</if>>
<<if _protCnt is 1>><<set _punishLabel to "应对夺账搜房 (0:10)">><<set _punishTarget to "MP Ledger Punish Seize 1">><<set _punishMin to 10>><</if>>
<<if _protCnt is 2>><<set _punishLabel to "应对转移截车 (0:10)">><<set _punishTarget to "MP Ledger Punish Transfer 1">><<set _punishMin to 10>><</if>>
<<if _protCnt gte 3>><<set _punishLabel to "应对总账清算 (0:12)">><<set _punishTarget to "MP Ledger Punish Liquidate 1">><<set _punishMin to 12>><</if>>
<<if !$mpWorldLedgerPunishLocked>><<mpcalculateicon>><<link _punishLabel>><<pass _punishMin>><<goto _punishTarget>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[转入暗道转移终局 (0:12)|MP Ledger Ending Escape]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
:: MP Ledger Punish Overdue 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>>
保护栏还空着，逾期栏又添了红杠，贝利手下的催账领班便带着铁锁闯进后厨，说要先搬走做饭的铁釜和过冬的煤块抵一抵账。他没有带账本，只认你肯不肯当场拿出凭据。<<if $mpGuildStanding and ($mpGuildStanding.wageMod or 100) gte 110>>行会的配给车刚送来一车备用木炭，领班看见门外的车印，说话略微收敛了半分。<<else>>后院空空荡荡，领班把铁锁敲得山响。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回问责 (0:02)|MP Ledger Punish Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpbargainicon>><<link [[据理核对旧收据 (0:12)|MP Ledger Punish Overdue 2]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 200 or ($mpGuildStanding and ($mpGuildStanding.wageMod or 100) gte 110)>><<set $mpLedgerPChoice to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpLedgerPChoice to "fail">><</if>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[以劳役代抵封灶费 (0:14)|MP Ledger Punish Overdue 2]]>><<pass 14>><<set $mpLedgerPChoice to "labor">><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Punish Overdue 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set $mpLedgerPunishDone_overdue to 1>>
<<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>>
<<if $mpLedgerPChoice is "ok">>
<<set $mpLedger.overdue to Math.max(0, ($mpLedger.overdue or 0) - 1)>>
<<set $mpAlert to Math.min(100, ($mpAlert or 0) + 2)>>
<<mpalertgain "催账领班记住了你的脸">>
你把前面核销过的收据拍在灶台上，指出那笔红杠是重记的息钱。领班骂骂咧咧收起铁锁，后厨大锅和煤堆保住了，分文未留。
<<elseif $mpLedgerPChoice is "labor">>
<<set $mpLedger.overdue to Math.max(0, ($mpLedger.overdue or 0) - 1)>>
<<tiredness 4>><<pain 2>><<stress 1>>
你替后厨扛了整晚的卸煤重活，手掌磨出厚茧，总算让领班松口划掉了这一笔逾期红杠。铁锅留在了灶上，但这趟顶罚没有任何工钱。
<<else>>
<<pain 3>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<mpLedgerLoseProtect>>
旧收据墨迹洇糊，领班推开你拎走半袋干煤充作滞纳金。你挡在灶前挨了两棍，虽护住了铁釜，名册却被翻走一页。
<</if>>
储煤间的煤油灯火苗轻轻跳动，外头走廊的木地板偶尔传来一声轻响。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回问责 (0:02)|MP Ledger Punish Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转入煤房歇息 (0:06)|MP Ledger Punish Soft End]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<if _protCnt gte 1>><<mpfist2icon>><<link [[查一护夺账惩罚线 (0:08)|MP Ledger Punish Seize 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Ledger Punish Seize 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>>
保护栏写进第一个名字后，贝利手下的账房便带着两名黑手套摸进储煤间，想搜走你压在煤堆下的那本连坐副册。他们没有敲门，只把楼梯口的灯吹灭了。<<if $mpSafehouses and $mpSafehouses.orphanage and ($mpSafehouses.orphanage.tier or 0) gte 1>>孤儿院安全屋的暗格早已加固，煤灰下面多了一层假底板。<<else>>煤房还没来得及修暗格，副册就塞在松动的砖缝里。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回问责 (0:02)|MP Ledger Punish Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[趁黑转移真账册 (0:12)|MP Ledger Punish Seize 2]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 210 or ($mpSafehouses and $mpSafehouses.orphanage and ($mpSafehouses.orphanage.tier or 0) gte 1)>><<set $mpLedgerPChoice to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpLedgerPChoice to "fail">><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpfist2icon>><<link [[在窄道硬拦黑手套 (0:14)|MP Ledger Punish Seize 2]]>><<pass 14>><<set $mpLedgerPChoice to "fight">><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Punish Seize 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set $mpLedgerPunishDone_seize to 1>>
<<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>>
<<if $mpLedgerPChoice is "ok">>
<<set $mpAlert to Math.min(100, ($mpAlert or 0) + 3)>>
<<mpalertgain "账房听见了烟道里的响动">>
<<tiredness 2>>
你摸黑将真副册塞进排烟道，只留一本抄满废柴数目的旧簿子在砖缝里。账房翻了半宿只拿到废纸，保护栏里的名字一个没漏，只是外头的眼线盯得更紧了，这趟周旋分文未得。
<<else>>
<<pain 4>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 3>><<mpLedgerLoseProtect>>
<<set $mpAlert to Math.min(100, ($mpAlert or 0) + 2)>>
黑手套的木棍在窄道里擦过你的肩头，你死死抵住煤房内门，让罗宾趁乱把真账册递了出去。门板踢裂了，一个名字还是被他们记住了，煤房里只剩冷风。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回问责 (0:02)|MP Ledger Punish Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退入煤房包扎 (0:06)|MP Ledger Punish Soft End]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<if _protCnt gte 2>><<sneakicon>><<link [[转查二护转移支线 (0:08)|MP Ledger Punish Transfer 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Ledger Punish Night [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>>
<<set _overdue to ($mpLedger.overdue or 0)>>
<<set _ally to ($mpLedgerNightAlly or 0)>><<set $mpLedgerNightAlly to 0>>
<<set _takenNow to (_overdue gte 3 and !($mpLedger.childTaken or 0))>>
<<if _takenNow>><<set $mpLedger.childTaken to 1>><<mpLedgerLoseProtect>><<set $mpWorldLedgerLoss to Math.max(1, ($mpWorldLedgerLoss or 0))>><<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>><</if>>
<<set $mpLedger.patrolPending to 0>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpLedgerNight to 1>>
<<set $mpLedger.lastNightDay to ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0)>>
后半夜，门厅的铜环被叩了三下，不急不缓，像早知屋里的人醒着。罗宾先醒，把最小的孩子往毯子里按了按，没敢点灯。
<br><br>
<<if _takenNow>>
楼下的黑手套已经念到一个名字，孩子被人从床上抱走，只留下一只空枕。你冲下楼时，门已经合上。
<<else>>
催账领班站在门槛外，摊开一张红杠密布的账单，说今晚要么见钱，要么见名字。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[关门装睡 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage Sleep]]>><<pass 2>><<if !_takenNow>><<set $mpLedger.overdue to ($mpLedger.overdue or 0) + 1>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<if _takenNow>>
<<link [[追到巷口去 (0:06)|MP Ledger Punish Night After]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpLedgerNightResult to "taken">><<stress 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mpbargainicon>><<link [[交出随身钱袋 (0:06)|MP Ledger Punish Night After]]>><<pass 6>><<set _cost to Math.min(($money or 0), 150 + _overdue * 100)>><<if ($money or 0) gte 50>><<set $money to Math.max(0, ($money or 0) - _cost)>><<set $mpLedger.overdue to Math.max(0, _overdue - 1)>><<set $mpLedgerNightResult to "paid">><<stress 3>><<else>><<mpLedgerLoseProtect>><<set $mpLedgerNightResult to "lost">><<stress 5>><<trauma 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[把名单藏进煤堆 (0:08)|MP Ledger Punish Night After]]>><<pass 8>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte (220 - _ally * 40) or ($willpower or 0) gte (320 - _ally * 40)>><<set $mpLedgerNightResult to "hidden">><<set $mpAlert to Math.min(100, ($mpAlert or 0) + 2)>><<stress 3>><<else>><<mpLedgerLoseProtect>><<set $mpLedgerNightResult to "lost">><<stress 5>><<trauma 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<fisticon>><<link [[叫醒大孩子一起挡 (0:10)|MP Ledger Punish Night After]]>><<pass 10>><<if _protCnt gte 1 or _ally is 1>><<set $mpLedgerNightResult to "fight">><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<else>><<mpLedgerLoseProtect>><<set $mpLedgerNightResult to "lost">><<stress 5>><<pain 2>><<trauma 2>><</if>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Ledger Punish Night After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set _result to ($mpLedgerNightResult or "")>>
<<set $mpLedgerNightAlly to 0>>
后半夜的声响终于停了，煤油灯只剩下一点火苗。罗宾把门闩重新插好，孩子们挤在一起，谁也没有再睡，只等天亮。
<br><br>
<<if _result is "paid">>
你把钱袋递出去，领班数了两遍才收手。
<<elseif _result is "hidden">>
名单塞进煤堆深处，他们翻了一圈什么也没找到。
<<elseif _result is "fight">>
大孩子们堵在楼梯口，领班骂了几句，终究退了出去。
<<elseif _result is "taken">>
你追到巷口，只看见一辆板车的影子，孩子没有回来。
<<else>>
他们从保护栏里点走一个名字，门在身后合上。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回床铺去 (0:04)|MP Loc Orphanage Sleep]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[回账本总枢 (0:04)|MP Ledger Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
